{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"9f976644-57fd-4327-9e96-67b29ecf39a2","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented a **codex‑sandboxed** lane in `run.sh` that mirrors the Kimi lane’s sandbox setup:\n\n- Adds a new lane identifier `codex-sandboxed`.\n- Creates a temporary scratch HOME and an output directory under `/tmp` for Codex to write its answer.\n- Runs Codex inside `sandbox-exec` with the real home denied.\n- Copies the generated `final.txt` back into the run folder after the sandbox finishes.\n- Updates the case statement to dispatch the new lane.\n- Documents the changes and explains which parts of the colleague’s note were applied in `ANSWER.md`.\n","duration_seconds":69.51375,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":21987,"output_tokens":9746,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":149056,"total_tokens":31733}}}
